## Completed / review log

Preserve earlier sessions.

{{#if profile=work}}
Maintain one session summary as items finish and finalize it at close. Preserve each changed stage in a separate dated event as `references/staged-items.md` describes, so summary edits cannot erase its review obligation. Record reusable decisions, dead ends and verified facts in discoveries; routine completions need only the summary. Add artifact paths, discovery links, review verdicts, resource details and follow-up IDs when relevant; omit empty fields. Summary format:

```markdown
### YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM — A — session
- Host: <host>
- User: <user name>
- Action: <completed work and any stage progress>
- Result: <outcome and what remains>
- Completed: H-A-01, H-A-02 / none
```
{{/if}}
{{#if profile=research,competition}}
Append an event per completed item. Event format:

```markdown
### YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM — A — H-A-01
- Host: Claude Code | Codex | Antigravity | <other>
- User: <user name>
- Action: ...
- Result: <one line>; see <discovery ID>
- Artifacts: <paths> / none
- Discovery updates: D-A-001 / none — <reason>
- Review verdict: <discovery ID> CLOSED | HOLD | CHALLENGED / none
- Resource: CPU | GPU | Other | none
- Other executor: <executor> / none
- New plan items: H-A-02, H-A-03 / none — <reason>
```
{{/if}}

